    "lock_theme: true hides the theme picker on phones so everyone gets the theme set here.",
    "To add a theme, copy one of the blocks below, give it a new key and label, and change the values.",
    "  dates: [start, end] as MM-DD. Ranges can wrap the new year, e.g. ['12-30', '01-02'].",
    "  colors: any you leave out keep the default. bg/glow = background, pad-* = D-pad, ok/ok-ring = OK button, sheet = pop-up panels.",
